e87efe0e33bae0df78b08f56e23620 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/172cbe8f/uploads/origins/60ccb788-1a11-4359-b6ef-7e82307579f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4acae8217ba5663cafbbef29eb2a337c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/172cbe8f/uploads/origins/60ccb788-1a11-4359-b6ef-7e82307579f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4acae8217ba5663cafbbef29eb2a337c, https://si.imgix.net/172cbe8f/uploads/origins/60ccb788-1a11-4359-b6ef-7e82307579f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4aa44dce4953f21ac8962c6fcc2010c3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/172cbe8f/uploads/origins/60ccb788-1a11-4359-b6ef-7e82307579f9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3ab2ed7ec3965d172963d954de702042 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for your Appeal. It is very appreciated. I like your style a lot, especially your recent piece of K9Kuro.\n\nFeels free to draw whatever your brain thinks of. If you would like me to give direction bounce it back to me and I will.\n\nOther wise, I will leave you my reference material. Thank you again!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@danam0danam0/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2923177, "client_id": 951125, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/467c2dbe/uploads/origins/bd54c354-f80d-463a-9a1d-0d2fdeba905b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae101c1b9b156954489588158f07ade6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/467c2dbe/uploads/origins/bd54c354-f80d-463a-9a1d-0d2fdeba905b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae101c1b9b156954489588158f07ade6, https://si.imgix.net/467c2dbe/uploads/origins/bd54c354-f80d-463a-9a1d-0d2fdeba905b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0d7aa762b48576df93258936df92d3e1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/467c2dbe/uploads/origins/bd54c354-f80d-463a-9a1d-0d2fdeba905b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a52cffe4151747450e8447b4d3d284c8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/467c2dbe/uploads/origins/bd54c354-f80d-463a-9a1d-0d2fdeba905b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7b9899b4d14f91f6e2102de96193258c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/467c2dbe/uploads/origins/bd54c354-f80d-463a-9a1d-0d2fdeba905b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7b9899b4d14f91f6e2102de96193258c, https://si.imgix.net/467c2dbe/uploads/origins/bd54c354-f80d-463a-9a1d-0d2fdeba905b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b6a28c13e7e419754b6c724f03b75abe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/467c2dbe/uploads/origins/bd54c354-f80d-463a-9a1d-0d2fdeba905b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6cd16f4881c4a9c1e7fe270dc2b1eed0 3x"}, "body": "Hello there,\nThank you very much for your appeal!\nI would be happy for you to draw Seo, with Alisa (her brown haired fairy companion) if possible.\nSeo is a very friendly gyaru who loves to hang out with friends and flirt with people every now and then, like a typical gyaru. Loves fashion, cooking and cleaning.\nAlisa is Seo's fairy partner who helps her cast magic. A very lazy NEET who likes to draw manga. Prefers yuri and yaoi.\nFeel free to draw them however you see fit.\nI look forward to your work!\n\nSeo & Alisa: https://photos.app.goo.gl/5nG89M2fYF6M4wmc9", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@danam0danam0/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2923177, "client_id": 1980644, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4057931a/uploads/origins/e039d7c1-4c10-482b-baeb-5ea470064270?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8c71e2d9141300bf2abcd90e1d68bda", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4057931a/uploads/origins/e039d7c1-4c10-482b-baeb-5ea470064270?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d8c71e2d9141300bf2abcd90e1d68bda, https://si.imgix.net/4057931a/uploads/origins/e039d7c1-4c10-482b-baeb-5ea470064270?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4633dd36ab0868881cb378b2e42c2453 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4057931a/uploads/origins/e039d7c1-4c10-482b-baeb-5ea470064270?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8c4284068977bb6fdc6fe79716643735 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4057931a/uploads/origins/e039d7c1-4c10-482b-baeb-5ea470064270?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5147666e9d4dae560bba3f8bba7a4faf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4057931a/uploads/origins/e039d7c1-4c10-482b-baeb-5ea470064270?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5147666e9d4dae560bba3f8bba7a4faf, https://si.imgix.net/4057931a/uploads/origins/e039d7c1-4c10-482b-baeb-5ea470064270?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=622df1832e3282d14b1afaf5542fd540 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4057931a/uploads/origins/e039d7c1-4c10-482b-baeb-5ea470064270?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6bb32ed85635277a21b1de16ffe50a51 3x"}, "body": "Hello and thank you for the appeal! 🥰 Your art looks lovely and I’d love to be able to order a piece from you! \n\nYui: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-8at0X49q7u6DFIG8q6sOKIEQQM0tMmb\n\nTo give a little more details to help, she’s a playful and cheerful character with a very seductive and flirty personality. She’s confident in her body, especially her butt and loves to show it off, often wearing outfits that show a lot of skin and loves the beach and yoga 💞 I’ll leave the composition up to you so feel free to choose whatever pose and outfit you feel fits! ✨ 💞 \n\nThank you for the opportunity! （╹◡╹）♡", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@danam0danam0/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2923177, "client_id": 1578801, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50c7e811/uploads/origins/54159aab-3abf-465c-8d9e-6772cf96c8a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dea822ec8242824df7034b6842696846", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50c7e811/uploads/origins/54159aab-3abf-465c-8d9e-6772cf96c8a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dea822ec8242824df7034b6842696846, https://si.imgix.net/50c7e811/uploads/origins/54159aab-3abf-465c-8d9e-6772cf96c8a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=15a4d0ea22b39a472a4241ec9615b82c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/50c7e811/uploads/origins/54159aab-3abf-465c-8d9e-6772cf96c8a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78d8cf5c1b23bbc5bcdf0f9fdd23abe8 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/50c7e811/uploads/origins/54159aab-3abf-465c-8d9e-6772cf96c8a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6eb2964041bd218e4b1fed032bb5f8a3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/50c7e811/uploads/origins/54159aab