a/4wyISHM", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@danam0danam0/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2923177, "client_id": 1780835, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/600ca89e/uploads/origins/581b3957-0cc6-4fe2-b13d-878f972b3ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=418ef000c49a02cd4d08e4b53a4b5b0a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/600ca89e/uploads/origins/581b3957-0cc6-4fe2-b13d-878f972b3ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=418ef000c49a02cd4d08e4b53a4b5b0a, https://si.imgix.net/600ca89e/uploads/origins/581b3957-0cc6-4fe2-b13d-878f972b3ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fbf8be50c0dbb65b83221f8cb0c55988 2x, https://si.imgix.net/600ca89e/uploads/origins/581b3957-0cc6-4fe2-b13d-878f972b3ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99bda4c4203f38a54a1cc409fc320d38 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/600ca89e/uploads/origins/581b3957-0cc6-4fe2-b13d-878f972b3ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e72cab2bdf00b1d5ac6575925e16a1d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/600ca89e/uploads/origins/581b3957-0cc6-4fe2-b13d-878f972b3ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e72cab2bdf00b1d5ac6575925e16a1d, https://si.imgix.net/600ca89e/uploads/origins/581b3957-0cc6-4fe2-b13d-878f972b3ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=961a63303d53e3fef0f49e48e22bf6ed 2x, https://si.imgix.net/600ca89e/uploads/origins/581b3957-0cc6-4fe2-b13d-878f972b3ca0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=49b19d9e7fda6b67fa0ce05ea7897cc5 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I wanted to see if I can get a skeb of my OC Geitor and two of his friends Taiga and Smol. The overall style of the art is like in Warhammer 40k's [Adeptus Mechanicus], primarily the [Skitarii Ranger] units. And the drawing plays off of the meme of the Pope who's holding something up as if he's blessing it.\n\nFrom the waist up is Geitor who isn't wearing his hat this time, is holding up Taiga. A ray of light shines down on Taiga as if she is blessed. Smol, from the waist up as well, is holding a fancy toaster to his chest in the background dressed similarly to Geitor is in shock and awe of Taiga. His cat ears protrude through his hood.\n\nThe interior of the scene is similar to the inside of a dark room within a sci-fi temple. A computer monitor glowing dimly in the background, a few lit candles, and an alter.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1E36Wm-nHMck43M3gYUJTZ6i4koq4NRR1?usp=drive_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@danam0danam0/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2923177, "client_id": 543344, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e1b3339/uploads/origins/ff85fb09-509d-4707-b72a-e33d0d9e8add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=400ac3ff23ee1c8aab5c82d2a184c519", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e1b3339/uploads/origins/ff85fb09-509d-4707-b72a-e33d0d9e8add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=400ac3ff23ee1c8aab5c82d2a184c519, https://si.imgix.net/9e1b3339/uploads/origins/ff85fb09-509d-4707-b72a-e33d0d9e8add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e235e3b74837b2973e8387a5a911334e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e1b3339/uploads/origins/ff85fb09-509d-4707-b72a-e33d0d9e8add?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=